{
	"notes": "God powers, shown as icon buttons in their toolbar tab. 'place' powers add a body: values are typical for that kind of object (the Sun's are real); a click puts it on a circular orbit around whatever dominates there, a drag throws it; a drag released on a body throws it into that body (aimed with the pull of everything), a click on a body drops it onto it. A power with flyby_kms sweeps through instead: closest to its star at the click point, leaving at flyby_kms once far away. 'fling' throws an existing body (into another, when released on it), 'delete' removes one. Every change spreads at the speed of light. The Tools tab: 'overlay' toggles a layer of the view ('on' when it starts shown), 'ruler' measures, 'pulse' sends a ring of light from a body, 'laws' opens the world laws.",
